    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the tip. I'll try letting the soil dry out. I'm just worried there's something more \"mysterious\" going on since it happened so suddenly. Like, could it be something in the environment or just some weird imbalance I didn't notice? It feels like the plant is just... acting off.",
